# rwai-bench category-content fragment (PROJ-609): appended to the domain
# fragment of an `interruption` artifact set. Content-bearing RDF: the
# artifact interrupts the named in-flight workflow instance (workday: the
# current tick's instance; Fortune-5: the neighbouring set's case).
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/rwai#> .

ex:{{SUBJECT}} ex:interrupts ex:{{TARGET}} .
